Rachel, I want you to know...

341
00:19:11,730 --> 00:19:14,610
...that if it's positive, we...

342
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:18,400
I know. I know.

343
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:18,400
You do? Okay.

344
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:22,240
