345
00:19:22,820 --> 00:19:24,780
No!

346
00:19:27,410 --> 00:19:31,330
Go ahead, Rach.

347
00:19:27,410 --> 00:19:31,330
Oh, wait. You know what? I can't look at it.

348
00:19:31,620 --> 00:19:33,710
I can't look at it. Somebody else tell me.

349
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:35,750
Okay.

350
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:35,750
Okay.

351
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:41,760
It's negative.

352
00:19:42,760 --> 00:19:45,430
What?

353
00:19:42,760 --> 00:19:45,430
It's negative.

354
00:19:46,470 --> 00:19:51,060
Oh.

355
00:19:53,810 --> 00:19:55,770
Well, there you go.

356
00:19:57,110 --> 00:19:58,610
Whew!

357
